# S-044: scaler creation failures make connect fail and leave the input list and the active flag unchanged.
vopen v I420 30 1 16 8 3
scaler create bad
vconnect v a 1 - NV12 16 8 PARTIAL 709
vstate v
scaler create fail
vconnect v a 1 - NV12 16 8 PARTIAL 709
vstate v
vinputs v
scaler create ok
vconnect v a 1 - NV12 16 8 PARTIAL 709
vstate v
vinputs v
vclose v
